&lt;p&gt;    @prabhjyotsingh Please help review. CI failure is not relevant. I have created &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-2007&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-2007&lt;/a&gt; for it&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
